# KRAKEN DEN — the structure at a deep-band kraken spawn site. Clean-room:
# a shell cluster grown onto a rock ledge, meat pockets inside it, the way a
# deep thing would build if it built at all.
#
# Shell is the armored material (high hp, high collision_resist), so a den is
# genuinely tough to take apart with a sidearm: this is a job for the ship's
# guns, which is the point of putting it in the deep band behind a life-support
# gate.
#
#   godot --headless --path . --script tools/ship_preview.gd -- ships/nest_den.ship
#
#   K  shell (the casing)   M  meat (the soft interior)   #  hull (the ledge)
#
# ONE connected piece — see the note in nest_roost.ship.

origin 4 3

